+84:1, 90:1, 108:1, 120:1, 135:1, 144:6, 150:1,
+168:1, 180:8, 192:7, 200:1
+```
+
+MEASURED: killed groups at `D<=120`:
+
+```text
+n   m   M                         V_s  u_s  rows  bound
+84  56  [64,82]                    3    1     1    IMmax=4 < Immin=5
+90  60  [45,80,88]                 4    1     2    IMmax=43/7 < Immin=7
